From: lean <chenlin@fnnas.com>
Subject: [PATCH] bcm63xx: adapt legacy platform drivers to Linux 6.18

Use firmware-node IRQ domains and the generic GPIO chip API while
preserving legacy platform data and bank-to-pin mappings.
Update appended DTB discovery, syscon lookup and B53 SPI callbacks.

Signed-off-by: lean <chenlin@fnnas.com>

